From cb47e98471fd7557c68dd829f4fa8a9dda6e9259 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: blame42 <346530647+git-blame-42@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 17:08:44 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Respond 404 for unknown events and 422 for invalid
 forms

Unknown event ids in show, edit, update and destroy now render an admin/events/not_found page with status 404 instead of a flash and redirect. Invalid create and update set status 422 before rendering the form. Statuses are checked over HTTP in EventsAccessTest and with http_response_code() in the controller test.
---
 app/Controllers/Admin/EventsController.php    | 14 +++-
 app/views/admin/events/not_found.phtml        |  3 +
 .../admin/events/NotFoundEventCest.php        | 25 +++++++
 tests/Integration/Access/EventsAccessTest.php | 69 ++++++++++++++++++-
 .../Admin/EventsControllerTest.php            | 42 ++++++++++-
 5 files changed, 145 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 app/views/admin/events/not_found.phtml
 create mode 100644 tests/Acceptance/admin/events/NotFoundEventCest.php

